{
  "start": [
    {
      "if": [
        "dues"
      ],
      "node": "dues_owed"
    },
    {
      "if": [
        "!flag:hunter:met_clerk"
      ],
      "node": "first"
    },
    {
      "node": "hello"
    }
  ],
  "nodes": {
    "first": {
      "text": "Welcome to the hall, {given}. Contracts go up on the board by the door, odd jobs on the other. Hunts leave from the artifact in the plaza: walk in and give it three words. The stash in the back room belongs to the hall: what you leave there stays for whoever comes after.",
      "do": [
        "set:hunter:met_clerk"
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Pay my dues ({dues} shards).",
          "if": [
            "dues"
          ],
          "goto": "paid",
          "do": [
            "pay_dues"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I've finished a job. My pay?",
          "if": [
            "jobs_done"
          ],
          "goto": "paid_jobs",
          "do": [
            "collect_jobs"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Does the Guild pay for hunts?",
          "goto": "pay"
        },
        {
          "text": "What work is there?",
          "do": [
            "jobs"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What is the Guild building?",
          "do": [
            "works"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have field notes to report.",
          "if": [
            "notes"
          ],
          "goto": "reported",
          "do": [
            "report_notes"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let me see the archive.",
          "do": [
            "archive"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I'd like to sit for {next_rank} ({rank_fee} shards).",
          "if": [
            "rank_ready"
          ],
          "do": [
            "sit_rank"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What would it take to rise in rank?",
          "if": [
            "!rank_ready"
          ],
          "goto": "rank_info"
        },
        {
          "text": "Show me the Hall of Hunters.",
          "do": [
            "hall"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I'd like to retire.",
          "if": [
            "!dues"
          ],
          "do": [
            "retire"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Where do I start?",
          "goto": "start"
        },
        {
          "text": "Thanks.",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    "hello": {
      "text": [
        "{given}. Back in one piece, I see.",
        "Contracts are on the board, {calling}.",
        "It's {date}. Don't keep the artifact waiting."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Pay my dues ({dues} shards).",
          "if": [
            "dues"
          ],
          "goto": "paid",
          "do": [
            "pay_dues"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I've finished a job. My pay?",
          "if": [
            "jobs_done"
          ],
          "goto": "paid_jobs",
          "do": [
            "collect_jobs"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Does the Guild pay for hunts?",
          "goto": "pay"
        },
        {
          "text": "What work is there?",
          "do": [
            "jobs"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What is the Guild building?",
          "do": [
            "works"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have field notes to report.",
          "if": [
            "notes"
          ],
          "goto": "reported",
          "do": [
            "report_notes"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let me see the archive.",
          "do": [
            "archive"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I'd like to sit for {next_rank} ({rank_fee} shards).",
          "if": [
            "rank_ready"
          ],
          "do": [
            "sit_rank"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What would it take to rise in rank?",
          "if": [
            "!rank_ready"
          ],
          "goto": "rank_info"
        },
        {
          "text": "Show me the Hall of Hunters.",
          "do": [
            "hall"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I'd like to retire.",
          "if": [
            "!dues"
          ],
          "do": [
            "retire"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Where do I start?",
          "goto": "start"
        },
        {
          "text": "Thanks.",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    "pay": {
      "text": "Pay? The Guild doesn't pay Hunters. Hunters pay the Guild: on the first Pulse of every Judgment, a share of what you've earned since the last. Pay here. Until you do, the contract boards are closed to you.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Something else.",
          "goto": "hello"
        },
        {
          "text": "Thanks.",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    "start": {
      "text": "Give the Wayfinder a Quiet word: that's the gentlest start. Take torches, take rations, take rope. And come back.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Something else.",
          "goto": "hello"
        },
        {
          "text": "Thanks.",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    "dues_owed": {
      "text": "You owe the Guild {dues} shards in dues, {given}. The boards stay closed to you until it's paid.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Pay my dues ({dues} shards).",
          "goto": "paid",
          "do": [
            "pay_dues"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I can't pay. Can I work it off?",
          "do": [
            "labour"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Not now.",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    "paid": {
      "text": [
        "The Guild thanks you.",
        "Noted in the ledger."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Something else.",
          "goto": "hello"
        },
        {
          "text": "Thanks.",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    "paid_jobs": {
      "text": [
        "The Guild pays for odd jobs, at least.",
        "Good work. Here."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Something else.",
          "goto": "hello"
        },
        {
          "text": "Thanks.",
          "end": true
        }
      ]
    },
    "reported": {
      "text": [
        "Filed. Whoever goes out next will be glad of it.",
        "Good. The archive's only as good as what you lot bring back."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
